      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see. Yeah, seems safe (for the time being, until the implementation of free_pages_exact() changes so that it is not safe anymore :))\n\nBTW looks like pKVM-ARM doesn\u0027t do that anymore, now it does something more generic (but also much more complex):\n\nhttps://android-review.googlesource.com/c/kernel/common/+/2950992\nhttps://android-review.googlesource.com/c/kernel/common/+/2968716\n\nI don\u0027t know much about that, afaik it was motivated by some ARM-specific use cases, so I suppose we won\u0027t need to do the same.",
      "parentUuid": "e8bd752c_04da175b",
      "revId": "a378ea95066fd0eedf10b699705834be58825f1a",
