      "message": "Agree, we can still use the simple way. Probably we can still use memcache to free page in v6.12 as most likely the free_page_exact() won\u0027t be changed in this version. And for v6.15, we can refactor this to use free_page_exact() together with the pkvm_vm/pkvm_vcpu. Does this make sense to you?",
